From 8bb3a16ce82d70e461977cfa76dc15a8be8ac137 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 06:10:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] KVMem kv9 port: message-aware multi-segment query (3060:
 QUERY_MAX 512 = head 256 + tail 256 with the tail aligned to the question;
 tool rounds 128+128 + user 128+128 from a row stash), official Eq.10 block
 scorer on the host (tiled AVX2 GEMM, candidate set excludes
 sink/recent/protected as in the paper), split-rank merge (paper sum / kv9
 nsum selectable), kv8b protect-new v2 as mandatory blocks, replay range = new
 input (cap 6144)

